d0620b15ba7cb9c7adea1d9.poster.avif?t=1741668612\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719030/extras/847c801efd0620b15ba7cb9c7adea1d9.webm?t=1741668612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719030/extras/847c801efd0620b15ba7cb9c7adea1d9.mp4?t=1741668612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express yourself and gain rewards with in-game choice events</h2><br>Red pill or blue pill? What color is The Dress? If a speeding trolley is hurtling towards either Mars or Lizardberg, who will you choose? Make your decisions and receive relic and stat rewards that will help (or hinder) your journey. Choice events add replayability (and chaos) to your quest!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719030/extras/dfd01c7ececcfead4c632ede4f0d299d.poster.avif?t=1741668612\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719030/extras/dfd01c7ececcfead4c632ede4f0d299d.webm?t=1741668612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719030/extras/dfd01c7ececcfead4c632ede4f0d299d.mp4?t=1741668612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle your way through the ranks of the internet</h2><br>As your power grows, so does the size of your challenges and the status of your enemies. From a lowly troll to the biggest influencers and their armies of followers, fight your way through the ranks of social media users and take on internet icons in a darkly comic satire of politics and culture.",
